  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "**B**.You are building a new user registration system and need to ensure that users create strong passwords. Your task is to write a program that validates a given password based on a set of security rules.\n\nA password is considered \"Strong\" if it satisfies all of the following conditions:\n\n\nIt must be at least 8 characters long.\nIt must contain at least one digit (0-9).\nIt must contain at least one uppercase letter (A-Z).\nIt must contain at least one special character from the set: `!`, `@`, `#`, `$`, `%`.\nIf any of these conditions are not met, the password is considered \"Weak\".\n\n\nInput Format\nA single line containing a string `P`, the password to be checked.\n\n\n\nOutput Format\nPrint \"Strong\" if the password meets all the criteria, otherwise print \"Weak\".",
